ns 0 products (since no product has it), confirming the filter list is not derived live from current product tags.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created new product 'QA Test Gadget Pro' via Admin with Tags='zephyrtag, qatestunique'. Searching for 'qatestunique' (a term that appears only in the tags field, not in name/description) on /products correctly returned exactly 1 result: QA Test Gadget Pro. Product detail page at /product/qa-test-gadget-pro correctly displays both new tags 'zephyrtag' and 'qatestunique' as tag chips.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited Sony WH-1000XM5 tags: removed 'headphones', renamed 'premium'->'premium-audio', added new tag 'studio'. Detail page reflects exact new tag set (wireless, noise-cancelling, premium-audio, studio). Searching 'studio' on /products returns exactly 1 matching product (Sony WH-1000XM5), confirming tag search integration.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created 'QA Test Gadget Pro' with Category=Fitness via Admin form (single-select combobox). Product appears correctly under /category/fitness (4 items: QA Test Gadget Pro, Bowflex SelectTech 552, Theragun Pro, Peloton Bike+) and does NOT appear under /category/tech or /category/home. Detail page shows category badge 'Fitness' and 'More in Fitness' related section.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigating to /category/fitness via nav link shows only Fitness-category products (4 of 10 total: QA Test Gadget Pro, Bowflex SelectTech 552, Theragun Pro, Peloton Bike+), each correctly tagged 'Fitness'. No Tech or Home products appear in the list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products page (9 products found) displays every product as a card exposing: image, category badge, name (as clickable link), price, star rating, brief description, and a 'Buy Now' purchase link. Verified across all 9 seed products (Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, MacBook Pro 14, Bowflex SelectTech 552, Theragun Pro, Peloton Bike+, Breville Barista Express, Philips Hue Starter Kit, Dyson V15 Detect, Sony WH-1000XM5).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified all sort modes on /products: 'Price: Low to High' produced ascending order ($199, $399, $549, $599, $699, $749, $1299, $1999, $2495); 'Top Rated' produced descending rating order (4.9, 4.8, 4.7, 4.7, 4.6, 4.6, 4.5, 4.5, 4.4); 'Newest' was default. Minimum Rating filter '4.5+ stars' correctly excluded the one sub-4.5 product (Philips Hue at 4.4), returning 8/9 products. Price Range slider control is present and functional (labeled $0-$2495 matching min/max product prices).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Edits not persisted across page reload\", \"actual\": \"After editing Sony WH-1000XM5 (price 399->379, rating 4.8->4.9, plus tag/spec/review changes) and confirming the changes appeared live in Admin, Home, and Detail views, reloading the app (navigating to http://localhost:6001/admin) reverted the product back to its original seed values (price $399, rating 4.8, original tags/specs). This was reproduced twice.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Admin Create/Edit form's Category field is a single-select combobox (only one category can be chosen at a time). Newly created product with Category=Fitness appears exactly once, only under /category/fitness, and shows a single category badge ('Fitness') on both list and detail views — confirming exactly one category per product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"